<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt forecasts invite higher debt rating - Birch.</title>
<headline>NZ govt forecasts invite higher debt rating - Birch.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's Finance Minister Bill Birch said on Wednesday he believed the government's latest economic forecasts were positive enough to invite an upgrade of the country's credit rating.</p>
<p>Birch made the comment in Hong Kong in an interview with Reuters Financial Television (RFTV), monitored in Wellington.</p>
